Subject: [PATCH 215/221] feat(area): Create -> Area -> Water / Road presets

Two more entries in the Create panel, where the legacy ones were: the engine's
own Water Volume sat in Create Object -> Area and Road in Create Object -> Misc,
and an author who wants water should not have to know that it is "a polygon plus
a component".

Neither is a new shape kind. "Water" is the polygon draw gesture with the Water
Volume function added at the end, "Road" is the spline draw gesture with the Road
function added at the end - exactly what the Box / Sphere / Polygon presets
already do with the Area function. Water asks for four points rather than three:
CreateArea will take three, but SetAreaPhysicsArea wants more than three
(WaterVolumeRenderNode.cpp:440), so a three-point volume would render and never
float anything.

Both shapes and both functions stay reachable through Add Component -> Area, so
nothing here is the only way to build either.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
